In other words, our proposal is to use the same initialization for all classes of symmetric autoencoders: the choice of the hypothesis class will only impact the architecture during the training phase, as it will restrict the exploration to the corresponding submanifold. We refer to Figure~\ref{fig:manifold} for a pictorial representation. 
