Our architecture is a hybrid of LLaVA~\cite{liu2024visual} and AnyGPT~\cite{zhan2024anygpt}, combining visual grounding with speech processing via discrete tokens. It integrates speech and vision inputs into a unified language model, denoted as $f_{\theta}(x)$, where $\theta$ represents model parameters. The overall architecture is shown in Figure~\ref{fig:arch}.

