In order to increase the LLM performance, we intertwine prompt knowledge injection and fine-tuning leveraging CKGs, specifically in scenarios where the LLM lacks domain-specific knowledge for a task. 
Enriching prompts with query-specific context is powerful, but for domain-specific tasks, injecting additional domain-specific knowledge through fine-tuning might further increase performance. 
