2) A multi-modal fusion paradigm that integrates beat-aware musical information with the textual dance instructions, enriching the model’s capacity for music-to-dance alignment.

3) A multi-modal alignment loss that leverages text as an intermediary to enhance the semantic connection between music and dance, reducing the gap between these modalities and improving the coherence and expressiveness of generated dance movements.


