		The transformation induced to the subinterval $I_{\tt b}$ is $\chi (T)$, with $\chi = \lambda^2 \circ \rho^2$.
		We have $\theta(\{ {\tt a,b,c} \}) = \R({\tt b}) = \{ {\tt bac, b, bacc} \}$, where
