\subsection{Visual Quality and BER.} 
Table \ref{tab:1} presents the numerical results for HiDDeN \cite{zhu2018hidden}, FASL \cite{zhang2021towards}, MBRS \cite{jia2021mbrs}, FIN \cite{fang2023flow}, and our ASW.
