\end{equation*} where $d$ is a document, $A$ is the set of rankers (retrievers), $a(d)$ is the rank of document $d$ in ranker $a$, and $u$ is a constant set to 40. Here we combine BM25 rankings with the base embedding model. 5) \textbf{RRF+BMEmbed}, the combination of the BM25 and the BMEmbed-finetuned model.



