& $O(MK^2) + O(M^2K)$
& Collaborative Representation using a dictionary of size $\sim M$. \textbf{Least-squares solution} is the dominant step. \\

& LRASR
& $O(T \cdot \min(MK^2, M^2K))$
& Low-Rank and Sparse Representation. $T$ = number of iterations. \textbf{SVD} or \textbf{ADMM} iterations are computationally intensive. \\

