& $O(MK) + O(M \log M)$
& Kernel Isolation Forest: complexity from feature mapping and \textbf{tree construction}. \\

& SVDD
& $O(M^3)$
& Support Vector Data Description. Solves a \textbf{quadratic programming (QP) problem}, leading to cubic time in $M$. \\

