Fig.~\ref{fig:ablation_new} (c) indicates that the SAM and MSFEM modules significantly enhance the compression performance. Meanwhile, Fig.~\ref{fig:ablation_new} (d)  reveals that the joint loss from detection and compression tasks markedly enhances detection performance, with the SAM effectively guiding the feature extraction process towards detection-oriented tasks.


