\section{Conclusion}

% 本文提出了一种创新的点云编码方法，分为基础层和增强层两个关键部分。基础层负责处理点云的基本几何坐标，而增强层专注于编码点云的附加残差信息。这些信息得到了我们设计的区域兴趣（ROI）网络和遮罩（Mask）的有效处理和优化。我们进一步开发了一种融合遮罩信息的率失真（RD）优化策略，这不仅提升了关键区域的编码质量，也将目标检测损失函数融入我们的损失函数中，以更好地服务于检测任务。为了更准确地提取点云轮廓特征，我们设计了多尺度特征提取模块（MSFEM），并在残差编码解码过程中引入了空间注意力模块（SAM）来提取更细致的语义信息。实验结果表明，我们的方法在ScanNet和SUN RGB-D数据集上不仅显著提高了压缩性能，还在高码率下实现了比传统和深度学习方法更精确的点云检测。展望未来，我们计划进一步探索面向机器感知的点云压缩任务，例如在KITTI数据集上进行压缩后的数据分析（检测、分割任务），并研究如何在压缩过程中保留更多语义信息或去除对语义理解不利的冗余码流。这些方向在实际应用中具有极高的研究和应用价值。

This paper introduces an innovative point cloud compression method comprising two key components: a BL and an EL. The BL is responsible for processing the geometry coordinates, while the EL focuses on encoding additional residual information of the point cloud. This information is effectively processed and optimized through the ROI prediction network and mask weighting process. We further develop a new RD optimization strategy that incorporates mask information, enhancing the encoding quality of critical areas and integrating detection loss into the total loss function to better guide detection tasks. To extract point cloud contour features more accurately, we design a MSFEM and a SAM in the residual encoding process for finer semantic information extraction. Experiment results demonstrate that our method improves compression performance on the ScanNet and SUN RGB-D datasets and achieves more accuracy of point cloud detection at high bitrates compared to traditional and learning-based point cloud compression methods. 
In future work, we aim to investigate multimodal point cloud compression alongside analysis tasks in the LiDAR dataset.
% such as detection and segmentation of the outdoor object.

% and research how to preserve more semantic information or remove redundant streams detrimental to semantic understanding during the compression process. These directions hold high research and practical value in real-world applications.

